10% of your base salary.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.130
So, this is what you should then add

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:45.450
on top to the numbers that
I will mention to you.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.550
And then of course if you look at

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:48.220
the full compensation package,

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.910
most firms also offer
something like a company car

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.300
that you will get even
as a junior consultant.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.600
And then there are other
benefits like insurances

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.680
or additional travel allowances
that will be provided to you

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.480
which you should add on
top of this base salary

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:02.890
that we will be discussing right now.

